  "prefLabel": "We 105.01 Summary of Duties",
  "priorExpiration": "1996-12-22",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 105.01 Summary of Duties. In accordance with RSA 482-B the board shall:\n\n(a) Protect the ground waters of the state;\n\n(b) Regulate the construction of water wells;\n\n(c) Regulate the installation of well pumps;\n\n(d) License water well contractors;\n\n(e) License well pump installers;\n\n(f) Keep records of wells;\n\n(g) Provide for penalties for violations;\n\n(h) Charge fees for licenses;\n\n(i) Promote cooperation among water well contractors, pump installers and governmental agencies;\n\n(j) Make available to the public information relative to ground water resources of the state; and\n\n(k) Adopt rules as necessary to implement the requirements of RSA 482-B.\n\nSource. #2557, eff 12-27-83; ss by #4730, eff 1-15-90; ss by #4898, eff 8-13-90; EXPIRED: 8-13-96\n\nNew. #6327, INTERIM, eff 8-24-96, EXPIRED: 12-22-96\n\nNew. #6448, eff 1-29-97; ss by #7306, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9177, eff 6-13-08",
